.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-STATUS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-status , rgostatus
.Nd show Reticulum interface and transport status
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm status
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl a
.Op Fl n Ar filter
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl s Ar key
.Op Fl r
.Op Fl timeout Ar duration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Queries a running shared instance over msgpack RPC and prints interface
statistics (and optionally link count).
Against a Go daemon, output may include local mesh health counters such as
IFAC and HMAC failures, announce signature rejects, unpack failures,
integrity fail rate, and stale link closes. Python
.Nm rnsd
does not populate those fields.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-timeout duration"
.It Fl config Ar dir
Config directory (default
.Pa ~/.reticulum-go ) .
.It Fl json
Emit JSON.
.It Fl a
Include all interfaces.
.It Fl n Ar filter
Filter interfaces by name substring.
.It Fl l
Include link count.
.It Fl s Ar key
Sort by rate, rx, tx, rxs, txs, traffic, announce, arx, atx, prx, ptx, or held.
.It Fl r
Sort ascending (default descending).
.It Fl timeout Ar duration
RPC timeout (default 10s).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
